{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "a1d845cc3e739b9192c83e6ec9da54142e904a6700ee12d0c112750e068c784a", "ja": "眠りはくま三郎とともに", "zh": "与熊三郎一同入眠", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "16f88fd0f117dc12fb15d6a78c871a0d678f0a4dc96f14cb0c8e9e4c168ece65", "ja": "秘密を持ち寄る会、最初はひなたから。明か\nされた秘密は、寝る時にぬいぐるみのくま三\n郎が必要という事だった。秘密を話す4人は\n雰囲気があった、と言うプロデューサー。次\nは美也が秘密を打ち明ける事に。", "zh": "交换秘密会，先从日向开始。她透露的秘密是，睡觉时需要布偶熊三郎陪着。制作人说，讲秘密的4个人都很有那种氛围。接下来轮到美也来坦白秘密了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f6a589db0223baf57eeb708c813755a8ae38bed246980e53e70d98dd3370fede", "ja": "（今日は、可憐達のユニットが、例の……秘密を\n持ち寄る日だ。みんな、うまくやれるだろうか……）", "zh": "（今天是可怜她们的组合分享那个……秘密的日子。大家能顺利进行吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "8527cc950f2aea39878eed0b0e64c96af78245a8dd81b9580705bde21656a4ea", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nこんなところに！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n原来在这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "bab0ef059a7b0d83ec398359704fda645b197dd1b5dbeae2dfd5c7c7db5bf8db", "ja": "やっと見つけました～。星梨花ちゃんと\nずいぶん探したんですよ～。", "zh": "总算找到您了～我和星梨花\n找了您好久呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f7712197399124d09e05203e9bda189e4d5b31ffa86e69ace71ef9ee57730311", "ja": "星梨花、美也……そうだったのか、ごめん。\nというか、そろそろミーティングの時間じゃないのか？", "zh": "星梨花、美也……原来是这样啊，对不起。话说回来，是不是差不多该开会了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "0249814d2d1c59fc29ff7e82ef543d3842e01454296d2a5022a50e398ddea0b2", "ja": "はい～。だから、{$P$}さんにも\n来てもらわないと～。", "zh": "是呀～所以也得请{$P$}先生过来才行～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "a7e4a69b114ad06754e6a611235a72c413f89899813f918ceee5ac7d2e862832", "ja": "今日は、ひなたさんの秘密からなんです！\nさあ、行きましょう♪", "zh": "今天要从日向小姐的秘密开始！\n来，我们走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "540f1bb77186415f3aed42ada7b08261afb762c907ed48cfcbd4dd0a8d542ba2", "ja": "えっ！？　いや……というか、\nみんなが秘密を話す場に、俺がいてもいいのか……？", "zh": "诶！？不……应该说，\n在大家分享秘密的场合，我待在这里真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "a00fb425fc8fbfbf530b9af4206e80518af26eb06eed57dbf07c36d99b243a46", "ja": "？　どうしてですか？\nみんな、待ってますよ！", "zh": "？　为什么呢？大家都在等着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "03223186a0e424b2310f8bd99fc2faf5383477e5751e1e68b4ccb59047e689d6", "ja": "{$P$}さんがいないと、\n始まりませんから～。さあさあ～♪", "zh": "要是{$P$}先生不在的话，\n可就没办法开始了～。快来快来～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "b7aa9705f92e537d14a78cbc76c76e1bacec1d751c14a96c1e8651875824491e", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん。\nお、お待ちしてました……♪", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生。\n等、等您很久了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "1a11c8a8b356cbeeec8fe4495b03b3d7335d2b6061486798985959e44b1580c5", "ja": "これで、秘密を持ち寄る会に\n参加する人はそろったねぇ。", "zh": "这样一来，要参加交换秘密的聚会的人就到齐了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "69cab790f47dd5b8600748cfa95f63c68359e763bb1cf090720c13b0ff3bb9a8", "ja": "てっきり、俺抜きでやるものかと……。ひなた、\n話を聞かれて大丈夫か？　嫌なら言ってくれれば……。", "zh": "我还以为你们要把我排除在外自己进行呢……日向，让大家听到你的秘密，真的没关系吗？要是不愿意的话，告诉我就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "a39ec1dda1c70df957df6ca43ce540bf6e874feb74b8da5f6fc76e86224a2320", "ja": "たしかに、秘密を聞かれるのは\nちょっこし恥ずかしいんだけども……。", "zh": "确实，被听到秘密还是有点不好意思的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "d9867521d7d9694c1cc35322bacbfd513e7b6b03e2d439ea1562f7cb193da553", "ja": "でも、イヤなんかじゃないよぉ。\n{$P$}なら、大丈夫だべさ！", "zh": "不过，我并不是讨厌哦。\n如果是{$P$}先生的话，就没问题啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "472fa0da693c08124d5eabd7ad827cae5d116428aa980c3e170205af141c1731", "ja": "それに、秘密を持ち寄る会がうまくいくかどうか、\n判定する人も必要ですしね～。", "zh": "而且，也需要有人来判断秘密分享会能不能顺利进行呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "00546ca367ffa2a22bc90b2b297345f9c3c349a4a477829b66dd1680d6651f3a", "ja": "それはまあ、そうか……わかった。\nじゃあ、襟を正して参加させてもらうよ。", "zh": "这倒也是……明白了。那我就郑重其事地参加吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "614fcd07088554608d3cddee131be71d469ef78edf0fdf6defdad8828bb5e19a", "ja": "ふふっ。なんだか、{$P$}さんが\n一番緊張してるみたいに見えます♪", "zh": "呵呵。总觉得，{$P$}先生看起来才是最紧张的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "1020a39943ab4ae5188c811514d4f506c1beaaecdb192f8332626e6d9211bdf7", "ja": "おしゃべりに……ひ、秘密とつくだけで、\nなんだか、不思議な感じになりますね……♪", "zh": "聊天……只要加上“秘、秘密”两个字，就会让人觉得有些不可思议呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bb4051b95fdf58eb540325cbc0f8e16b23707c0c7f774a931991b0c50c5f797d", "ja": "ああ、なんだか緊張するな……。それじゃ\nひなた、準備が整ったらいつでも始めてくれ。", "zh": "啊，总觉得有点紧张……那么，日向，准备好了就随时开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "ad33cee863909455d9d5df52aa8a912cc694cb98f0070afa53d17d744eb36538", "ja": "こほん。そ、それじゃあ……\nあたしの秘密なんだけどね……。", "zh": "咳咳。那么、那么……\n这是我的秘密哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "77d37a4ec5b74bd6a30d6b6efcd039ec50cec9dd32bf562b50a48e70c2d4d537", "ja": "いざ言うとなると、やっぱり恥ずかしいねぇ。\n顔が火照ってきちゃったべさ……うう。", "zh": "真要说出来，果然还是好害羞呀。\n脸都发起烫来了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "6628b75266dffc8a115ad3f2ea48e88ed0a570d5a3ec5ed1d42d22daac73577d", "ja": "ひなたさん、がんばって！", "zh": "雏菜，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "b2de81c3bfa415823a4cc586efddb0fb0018b1bed477053dfe8e1b98f373346a", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、落ち着いてくださいね～。\nお茶を飲みますか～？", "zh": "日向，冷静下来哦～。\n要喝茶吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "9f2f44a3a291de8480090495e85c2320f65fdeb751d6b3a73773d261be9ff8b5", "ja": "う、うん。ありがとねぇ。\nその、あたしの秘密っていうのは……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。谢谢你呀。\n那个，我的秘密就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "c918e5f18e619d5cbf21a421aab37d6733f08a54049eff672d89baaa442986cb", "ja": "ね、寝る時に、くま三郎を抱いて\n寝てること、なんだべさ……。", "zh": "我、我睡觉时会抱着熊三郎睡……就是这个秘密……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "a5753f8474cca4302fb35e9aaf8743f83f21ffcc1af4d88db74001e36fc5cb25", "ja": "くま三郎……た、確か、ひなたちゃんが\n好きな、マスコットキャラ……だよね……？", "zh": "熊三郎……我、我记得是日向喜欢的吉祥物角色……对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "385837325ccac43f506ae4598a1f17a844690b197ddcb82f2b477d34a35480c4", "ja": "そうなんだよぉ。懸賞に応募したら、\n大きなくま三郎のぬいぐるみが当たってねぇ。", "zh": "是这样的呀。参加抽奖后，居然抽中了一个很大的熊三郎玩偶呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "05adcbb96f765ac882ca1e2a55e73eb27bd15c216d977b460bb6bd1d6c12dbe4", "ja": "うれしくって抱いて寝てたら、家では、\nくま三郎なしで寝られなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "因为太开心了，我还抱着它睡觉，结果在家里已经变得没有熊三郎就睡不着了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "68bc8e8275dd3207ce3bc4f8579aea06559efac96ed666ca2b1371517f293097", "ja": "なるほど……。", "zh": "原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "6f878231826121e5ce9e8eccd9671b0abfb7f18fcc37afda3ff7f9d3596726b9", "ja": "あ……けど、あんまし、他の人には言わないでねぇ？\nここにいるみんなとだけの、秘密にしてほしいべさ。", "zh": "啊……不过，这事儿别跟其他人说哦？\n我想让它成为只属于这里大家的秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "bf9b78970616081c88071a45b810408c79fff987bdd462178e5312d94e57cdd1", "ja": "はい！　もちろんです。\nひなたさんの秘密は、絶対に守ります！", "zh": "好的！当然没问题。\n我绝对会保守小日向的秘密！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "e1b389faf6d81ad79232eda15f851e366628423d294585fb8fdbcdab248fad01", "ja": "けど、とってもひなたちゃんらしい\nかわいい秘密で、ほっこりしますな～♪", "zh": "不过，这是非常符合日向风格的可爱秘密，让人心里暖洋洋的呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "31928abb4eef4f8f30ea941929895cf02e342fc0ee875d19e405ba993b47c973", "ja": "そうですね……ひなたちゃん、あの……ひ、\n秘密にしてるのは、やっぱり恥ずかしいから……？", "zh": "是啊……日向她……那个……是、是因为觉得保守这个秘密，果然还是很害羞吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "6f6dff65432a732945eca563470ff6cba795a390e7d7e0a349ee6f7f7a226bf1", "ja": "そうだねぇ。子どもっぽくて\n恥ずかしいってのもあるけど……。", "zh": "是呀……觉得像个小孩子一样，害羞也是一个原因，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1034_035hin", "source_sha256": "3b048f4b22a664119438cda7bd1a3fd9754afbf9f73907059fc32a92af12d2ae", "ja": "あたしがさびしがってるって思われてしまったら、\nみんなに心配かけてしまうかもって思ってねぇ……。", "zh": "因为要是被大家觉得我很寂寞的话，我想可能会让大家担心呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "0eb5367c8301a445752e04ba2900a562874294518cf283530e758793164df1c8", "ja": "ひなたちゃんは優しいですな～。では、本当に\nさみしくなった時は……私たちを呼んでくださいね～？", "zh": "小日向很温柔呢～那么，真的感到寂寞的时候……请叫我们过来哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "dc5fd2dfd0d9ba6443391c4fff96e7f48cda16910fe537a5dcda734074a09b09", "ja": "うん……ひ、秘密を知ってる、仲だもん……♪\nさみしくなった時は、遠慮なく言ってね……？", "zh": "嗯……毕、毕竟我们可是，共享过秘密的关系嘛……♪\n觉得寂寞的时候，不用客气尽管开口哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1037_022ser", "source_sha256": "1bb9000767d7ebb7b271c006d8fb78ff985d8d05caf73efa0ff64482793f55b7", "ja": "その時はわたしも、パパにお願いしてお泊りします！\nみんなで一緒に、お布団に入りましょうね♪", "zh": "到时候我也会拜托爸爸，让我留下来过夜！  \n大家一起钻进被窝吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1038_035hin", "source_sha256": "1bddf2a5e22c7555a14984177f5aaaf5a83dbbc7fee8bf7b35e9147448275cf9", "ja": "わぁ……4人もいたら、きっとさびしさなんて\n吹っ飛んじゃうねぇ。えへへ、ありがとねぇ、みんな。", "zh": "哇啊……要是能有4个人的话，寂寞肯定一下就\n烟消云散了呢。诶嘿嘿，谢谢你们呀，大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1039_035hin", "source_sha256": "773edfabb1e3a419317728eb63a66d759a44244d02c27d8e082ce17204f174ad", "ja": "最初は恥ずかしかったけども、秘密を話すと、なんだか\nすっきりするもんだねぇ。{$P$}。", "zh": "一开始还挺不好意思的，不过把秘密说出来之后，感觉整个人都轻松多了呢。{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "1f8f85335761e05f68e107afa21e3b251d9c4c534b0e8cbd42143e80e0cb051f", "ja": "ああ。傍から見ていても、色々な表情が見えたよ。\n良かったんじゃないか？", "zh": "啊。就算只是从旁边看，也能看到各种各样的表情呢。这样不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "4e0d2fcc3faed9c948f484ec104f83766fd6a516f66a88dd581aff0e9a80f654", "ja": "それじゃあ、成功ってことですね！", "zh": "这么说来，就是成功了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "ddeee9599d24b46ba00b346db03fe032f01a8b81f009d89937960b541ad02e96", "ja": "ああ。楽しいだけじゃない、\n雰囲気のあるおしゃべりになっていたと思う！", "zh": "嗯。我觉得这已经成了一场不只是开心，还有氛围感的聊天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1043_045kar", "source_sha256": "fc30cc7983473a6e0b8465fdbaf2041d43fd0c94b764b1bc90dc3aaf67ac0ac2", "ja": "よ、よかった……♪　それじゃあみんな、\nこの調子で……PV撮影まで、がんばろうね……！", "zh": "太、太好了……♪　那大家，\n就保持这个状态……到PV拍摄为止，都要加油哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_03_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "425ddbe9a91a4bb5ba1ca70890d9be9cfd4bdf162dd7024360ce47f5d133250a", "ja": "はい～。では次回は……\n私の秘密を打ち明けることにしましょう～。むふふ。", "zh": "好的～那么下次就……\n来坦白我的秘密吧～嘻嘻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
